  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a blender or food processor, combine yellow chilies, garlic, fish sauce, brown sugar, soy sauce, and coconut milk (if using). Blend until smooth.",
    "Add the blended mixture to the chicken pieces and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the grill with vegetable oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Transfer the skewers to a plate and garnish with chopped thai basil leaves and bruised lemongrass.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
